{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "title": "Heat pump and hot water behind a gateway",
  "description": "The heat pump and the hot-water tank are controlled by their own system, linked to KNX by a Modbus gateway. Enter the tank, flow, and return temperatures on the gateway: they are sent on KNX and shown on the display. The keys select the heating mode and request a hot-water boost; the gateway forwards these commands to Modbus, which is not simulated. The energy meter measures the heat pump in kW and kWh and the water heater in W and Wh; enter a measured power to change it.",
